      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I didn’t even know they changed it since I haven’t been able to play since my first experience back in 2017. Looking at the new one, it feels like a complete downgrade experience-wise. It breaks a lot of the immersion for me.\n\nWhat I would love to see is a combination between the two. Tips, rules, important as always, but I want to feel like I’m traveling through space to another world again. The moments between worlds were charming. It was a brief and pretty silence. \n\nAs a solution, why not bring back how it used to be and add more panels around you for rules and tips. I’m sure it could be done well.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
